{{ comment(_('"Other" means: sure that nothing above matches. Without it, such files go to "to sort", which means: we do not know.')) }}
# [[classify.rules]]
# name = "{{ _("Other") }}"
# match = "other_category"
# category = "{{ _("Other") }}"

{{ comment(_("Your own places: a photo whose GPS position lies within radius_m metres of one goes to its name, with a 'place' rule above; a photo without GPS follows the other photos of its event. One place can be home = true: trips are measured from it. Name them on a map with 'media-hygiene places', or copy the latitude and longitude from a map. Nothing leaves your computer: towns and countries are named from GeoNames data shipped with the image.")) }}
